//! The `text-align-last` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets how
//! the last line of a block or a line, right before a forced line break, is aligned.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | start | end | left | right | center | justify | match-parent
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-text-4/#propdef-text-align-last
//!
//! Author guide:
